WEBVTT

00:00:02.128 --> 00:00:05.423
Let me out!

00:00:17.852 --> 00:00:21.439
Damn it... It's been a week.

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:23.649
Why is this happening?

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:30.281
This is the Outlaw?

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:35.077
There isn't any sign outside...

00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:37.079
But I guess there wouldn't be.

00:00:37.288 --> 00:00:39.206
You're here on Margery-saws
recommendation.

00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:41.333
Don't screw up.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:02.813
This is the right place, isn't it?

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.529
U-Um, I'm here as the representative
of the Chanter of Elegies, Margery Daw...

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:13.491
Keisaku Sato-kun, right?

00:01:16.911 --> 00:01:18.662
Come this way.

00:01:18.871 --> 00:01:20.331
<i>Okay -</i>

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:24.084
Would you give me your cell phone?
For security reasons.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:26.712
And anything else on you that
could communicate with the outside.

00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:28.339
Oh.

00:01:44.063 --> 00:01:46.649
It's different than what I'd imagined.

00:01:59.537 --> 00:02:00.955
Um...

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:08.754
Hey!

00:02:08.963 --> 00:02:12.258
What is this? Hey! Open up!

00:02:30.568 --> 00:02:34.196
<i>Now set free</i>

00:02:34.405 --> 00:02:40.578
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:44.456
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:50.504
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:02:50.713 --> 00:02:53.048
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:02:53.257 --> 00:02:55.676
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:58.220
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:02:58.429 --> 00:03:03.100
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:03:03.309 --> 00:03:05.644
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:03:05.853 --> 00:03:08.314
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:08.522 --> 00:03:10.941
<i>Your existence</i>

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:16.030
<i>Cry out</i>

00:03:16.238 --> 00:03:18.449
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:18.824 --> 00:03:21.201
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.787
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:03:23.996 --> 00:03:31.920
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:03:32.129 --> 00:03:38.510
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.646
I can't believe I just
allowed them to capture me...

00:03:49.688 --> 00:03:51.899
What am I even doing?

00:03:52.941 --> 00:03:55.235
And what's happened to Misaki City?

00:03:57.363 --> 00:04:00.324
"In Your Hand"

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:15.005
Why couldn't I do anything?

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.509
I was finally able to meet Yuji alone.

00:04:18.717 --> 00:04:22.012
It was my chance to turn things around.

00:04:22.221 --> 00:04:26.517
Maybe I could have
even undone the brainwashing.

00:04:29.103 --> 00:04:32.022
No... Nothing would have worked.

00:04:32.231 --> 00:04:33.899
Most likely.

00:04:34.983 --> 00:04:38.904
I was so scared of his touch...

00:04:39.113 --> 00:04:43.492
Like it might take something from me.

00:04:43.701 --> 00:04:45.119
Why?

00:04:54.169 --> 00:04:55.963
You idiot!

00:04:56.171 --> 00:04:57.965
Calm down a little.

00:04:58.173 --> 00:04:59.633
Calm down?

00:04:59.842 --> 00:05:03.262
After you used my name
to send a letter to Wilhelmina,

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.180
you're asking me to calm down?

00:05:05.389 --> 00:05:09.309
This is why I prefer to use handwritten
letters for official communication!

00:05:09.518 --> 00:05:12.479
But this is our chance...

00:05:12.688 --> 00:05:15.149
The situation in
Misaki City is really bad.

00:05:15.357 --> 00:05:17.985
She has to come.

00:05:18.193 --> 00:05:19.111
Really bad?

00:05:19.319 --> 00:05:24.491
If we make her talk to Commander
Sawallisch, she won't be able to ref--

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.201
Shut up!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.079
Y-You don't have to get so mad.

00:05:29.288 --> 00:05:32.124
Frieder-kun is doing
his best for everyone's sake!

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:33.917
No, Brigid...

00:05:34.126 --> 00:05:38.255
What we're saying is that there
are some things you just shouldn't do.

00:05:38.464 --> 00:05:42.301
Then we're just going to
ignore someone of her power?

00:05:42.509 --> 00:05:46.597
After what happened with
Margery Daw, she's all alone.

00:05:46.805 --> 00:05:49.183
Heaven is smiling on us here.

00:05:49.391 --> 00:05:51.226
Did something happen
to Margery-san?

00:05:51.435 --> 00:05:52.186
Tell me!

00:05:52.394 --> 00:05:54.021
Please!

00:05:54.229 --> 00:05:57.024
The boy Margery sent?

00:05:57.232 --> 00:05:58.942
Fine, stand back.

00:05:59.151 --> 00:06:01.153
Oh, no! Get back, Sato-kun...

00:06:01.653 --> 00:06:03.071
Hurry!

00:06:05.699 --> 00:06:09.912
You moronic bomber! If you kill
the kid, everything will be ruined!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.872
I just wanted to test his luck.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.291
Don't get so angry.

00:06:15.459 --> 00:06:18.587
Okay! You're alive, and you
aren't missing any limbs, right?

00:06:18.796 --> 00:06:21.757
We take good care
of people who have luck.

00:06:22.966 --> 00:06:26.094
I'm the Scatterer of
Sparkling Light, Rebecca Reed.

00:06:26.303 --> 00:06:28.764
This is Balar,
the Opened Eye of Incineration.

00:06:28.972 --> 00:06:30.599
Hi, there.

00:06:35.354 --> 00:06:37.272
Margery-san is in a coma?

00:06:37.481 --> 00:06:39.566
That's impossible!

00:06:39.775 --> 00:06:41.819
It still happened,

00:06:42.027 --> 00:06:45.489
according to Wilhelmina's report.

00:06:45.697 --> 00:06:46.865
Margery-san...

00:06:47.074 --> 00:06:50.285
I understand that you
may not want to believe this,

00:06:50.494 --> 00:06:53.914
but something bad really
has happened in Misaki City.

00:06:57.459 --> 00:06:58.752
Stay put.

00:06:58.961 --> 00:07:00.462
Let me go!

00:07:00.671 --> 00:07:03.215
I have to get back to her!

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:07.177
Your being there won't help.

00:07:07.386 --> 00:07:08.971
Even if that's the case,

00:07:09.179 --> 00:07:11.056
if something happens to
one you care for, you worry!

00:07:11.265 --> 00:07:14.309
One you care for, huh?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.816
U-Um... Rebecca-san,
are you friends with Carmel-san?

00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:22.359
Why?

00:07:22.568 --> 00:07:26.071
I heard you mention a letter to her.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.448
Oh, that's right...

00:07:28.657 --> 00:07:31.368
Wilhelmina and I are...

00:07:31.577 --> 00:07:33.829
Well, I guess you
could say old friends.

00:07:34.037 --> 00:07:34.371
Friends?

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.998
Yeah.

00:07:40.961 --> 00:07:43.171
Hello?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.383
Yeah, I know. I'm on my way.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.512
There's a meeting.

00:07:50.721 --> 00:07:52.639
You stay here.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.268
Wait...

00:08:02.149 --> 00:08:03.775
Damn it!

00:08:07.738 --> 00:08:08.989
Jeez“.

00:08:09.197 --> 00:08:11.617
Kids just don't know when to stay put.

00:08:11.825 --> 00:08:13.744
Doesn't that apply to you?

00:08:13.952 --> 00:08:14.620
But...

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:16.330
Hmm? What is it?

00:08:16.538 --> 00:08:21.460
Lately, you've been strangely irritable.

00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:25.130
He might be helpful
in getting you past it.

00:08:58.997 --> 00:09:00.999
I knew it... A Rinne.

00:09:01.208 --> 00:09:02.459
Hey, Specialist of Everything,

00:09:02.668 --> 00:09:04.795
this one's mine!

00:09:32.447 --> 00:09:34.074
Easy.

00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:38.704
Scatterer of Sparkling Light,

00:09:38.912 --> 00:09:42.541
I'd prefer some
advance warning, indeed!

00:09:54.302 --> 00:09:56.138
Same to you.

00:09:58.765 --> 00:10:02.102
Back then, going to her
aid would have been simple.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.064
She isn't good at
asking for what she wants.

00:10:06.273 --> 00:10:08.984
I bet she really is in trouble...

00:10:15.782 --> 00:10:17.868
So, this is the last response

00:10:18.076 --> 00:10:20.245
to my formal requests
for help, indeed.

00:10:20.454 --> 00:10:22.289
Nothing promising.

00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:27.085
They believe this battle
will take everyone we have.

00:10:27.294 --> 00:10:31.131
It's only natural for Zurich and Tokyo
to want to hold their forces in reserve.

00:10:31.339 --> 00:10:34.968
I am prepared to go alone, indeed.

00:10:42.893 --> 00:10:46.646
I thank you for making
the difficult journey here,

00:10:46.855 --> 00:10:50.150
Guardian of Steady Passage,
Samuel Demantius.

00:10:50.358 --> 00:10:53.779
And Zirnitra, the
Peaceful Shield of Scales.

00:10:53.987 --> 00:10:57.365
Normally, we would have responded
immediately to your summons.

00:10:57.574 --> 00:11:00.410
I apologize for our late arrival.

00:11:00.619 --> 00:11:05.624
We shall do everything we
can to fulfill your expectations of us.

00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.627
We shall rely heavily
upon you, in the days to come.

00:11:08.835 --> 00:11:09.795
Indeed.

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:13.381
I do have a passing
regret that I must force you into

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.592
so many critical battles.

00:11:19.763 --> 00:11:22.057
We shall carry out our tasks together,

00:11:22.265 --> 00:11:24.101
Mother Courage,

00:11:24.309 --> 00:11:27.562
Supreme Commander Sophie Sawallisch,
Braider of Trembling Might.

00:11:27.771 --> 00:11:31.191
And the Thunder Blade
of Banishment, Takemikazuchi.

00:11:31.399 --> 00:11:35.654
We shall join the other Flame Hazes.

00:11:36.947 --> 00:11:38.573
Welcome, Sirotci.

00:11:38.782 --> 00:11:41.493
I am so very glad you've come.

00:11:45.288 --> 00:11:49.126
As you are aware, our
Shanghai Headquarters is gone.

00:11:49.334 --> 00:11:51.586
As our final line of
defense in the eastern theater,

00:11:51.795 --> 00:11:54.881
the Tokyo Headquarters has
dramatically increased in importance.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.844
A large-scale battle with Ball Masque

00:11:59.052 --> 00:12:02.639
will likely occur in Tokyo
or in the surrounding environs.

00:12:02.848 --> 00:12:04.558
S-So.

00:12:04.766 --> 00:12:10.147
We need as many strong
Flame Hazes as we can get, right?

00:12:10.355 --> 00:12:11.189
Yes.

00:12:11.398 --> 00:12:13.191
Wilhelmina Carmel will be

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:16.820
tasked with command of the Tokyo
Headquarters, alongside yourself.

00:12:17.028 --> 00:12:20.282
But doesn't Wilhelmina want

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.326
to rescue the captured Nietono?

00:12:23.535 --> 00:12:26.329
And do we have the right to stop her?

00:12:26.538 --> 00:12:29.791
That is why I am asking
you to persuade her.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.752
As a warrior, you must see the futility

00:12:32.961 --> 00:12:35.463
of what she seeks to accomplish.

00:12:36.965 --> 00:12:39.384
The Palace of the Stars
is the very heart of Ball Masque.

00:12:39.593 --> 00:12:43.054
The Trinity: Sydonay, Bel-Peol, and Hecate,

00:12:43.263 --> 00:12:45.348
as well as many other
powerful foes lie within.

00:12:45.557 --> 00:12:49.895
To mount a rescue operation
there isn't a long shot.

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:51.146
It's impossible.

00:12:51.354 --> 00:12:53.106
You may be right...

00:12:53.315 --> 00:12:54.941
To lose such a powerful Flame Haze

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:58.403
to a hopeless battle
would be a costly blow.

00:12:58.612 --> 00:12:59.946
The most rational choice

00:13:00.155 --> 00:13:03.700
would be for her to join us,
for her sake, as well.

00:13:03.909 --> 00:13:06.828
The more rational he sounds,

00:13:07.037 --> 00:13:09.873
the more this bothers me...

00:13:10.081 --> 00:13:11.499
Even if that's the case,

00:13:11.708 --> 00:13:14.002
if something happens to
one you care for, you worry!

00:13:15.629 --> 00:13:17.255
Oh, so that's it!

00:13:17.464 --> 00:13:20.342
I'm worried about her.

00:13:21.551 --> 00:13:24.054
You saved me. Thanks.

00:13:24.262 --> 00:13:27.265
Anyone would have
done the same, indeed.

00:13:30.936 --> 00:13:32.103
At times like this,

00:13:32.312 --> 00:13:36.441
you should act like
I owe you one, Wilhelmina.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:40.278
Very well. You owe me,
indeed, Rebecca Reed.

00:13:41.488 --> 00:13:45.408
It might be nice to repay that favor,
a couple hundred years later.

00:13:45.617 --> 00:13:48.286
Rebecca Reed...

00:13:48.495 --> 00:13:51.748
Even if you're against it, she will come.

00:13:51.957 --> 00:13:53.625
She must...

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:55.418
Because of the kid?

00:13:55.627 --> 00:13:56.294
Yes.

00:13:56.503 --> 00:14:00.423
We'll use him to bring her here.

00:14:00.632 --> 00:14:03.677
That's quite a rational decision.

00:14:03.885 --> 00:14:07.806
U-Um, Frieder-kun
doesn't really like it, either.

00:14:08.014 --> 00:14:10.767
S-So don't look so mad...

00:14:10.976 --> 00:14:13.603
A-Ah, Rebecca-chan?

00:14:18.066 --> 00:14:21.486
Damn it... It isn't working.

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:26.825
R-Rebecca-chan,
that's dangerous...

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:28.868
What are you doing?!

00:14:29.077 --> 00:14:32.956
This isn't for me. See you...

00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.252
Wait, Rebecca Reed!

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.088
This will be the
greatest battle in history!

00:14:40.297 --> 00:14:41.089
You're an important--

00:14:41.298 --> 00:14:42.716
Move, Frieder.

00:14:42.924 --> 00:14:44.301
If you don't get out of my way,

00:14:44.509 --> 00:14:48.388
I'll blow this building up so spectacularly,
the entire city will have to notice.

00:14:51.141 --> 00:14:52.976
This is...

00:15:04.279 --> 00:15:05.947
Hey there.
Sorry to keep ya waiting.

00:15:06.156 --> 00:15:07.991
R-Rebecca-san?

00:15:11.077 --> 00:15:12.912
We're leaving!

00:15:13.121 --> 00:15:14.456
Leaving?

00:15:14.664 --> 00:15:16.958
The whole thing started bothering me,

00:15:17.167 --> 00:15:19.794
so I decided to go help my friend.

00:15:20.003 --> 00:15:23.006
While I'm at it, I can take
you to Misaki City, wasn't it?

00:15:23.214 --> 00:15:25.216
I'll send you back there.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.139
I'm grateful to you, Sauté.

00:15:31.348 --> 00:15:32.182
Sauté?

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:35.352
Right now, my position's too important

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:38.980
to allow me to just
run off to Wilhelmina's aid.

00:15:39.189 --> 00:15:40.023
Ah...

00:15:40.231 --> 00:15:43.777
So basically, you ended up
useful for something.

00:15:47.906 --> 00:15:49.866
In other words,

00:15:50.075 --> 00:15:52.243
that stubborn little girl
left the Tokyo Headquarters,

00:15:52.452 --> 00:15:54.579
to go to Wilhelmina?

00:15:54.788 --> 00:15:56.831
Yes. I'm very sorry.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:01.878
B-But, Rebecca-chan looked so upset,
we didn't have a choice...

00:16:02.087 --> 00:16:06.049
Did any other slayers
agree with Rebecca Reed?

00:16:06.257 --> 00:16:07.801
No. None.

00:16:08.009 --> 00:16:12.138
She wouldn't allow them.

00:16:12.347 --> 00:16:14.099
Then it cannot be helped.

00:16:14.307 --> 00:16:16.684
If it won't cause
additional morale problems,

00:16:16.893 --> 00:16:19.604
we'll just have to let her go, for now.

00:16:21.106 --> 00:16:22.565
"Ocha no Mizu Bridge Exit"

00:16:22.565 --> 00:16:24.609
Here... A parting gift.

00:16:30.198 --> 00:16:31.449
What are these?

00:16:31.658 --> 00:16:34.119
Wilhelmina's reports.

00:16:34.327 --> 00:16:37.080
They'll explain what
happened in Misaki City.

00:16:37.288 --> 00:16:41.751
And they contain some plans
for the upcoming war, as well.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.211
Don't lose them.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.462
R-Right!

00:16:44.671 --> 00:16:47.507
All right, get back to Margery.

00:16:48.883 --> 00:16:51.052
You're not coming with me?

00:16:51.261 --> 00:16:52.512
Sauté,

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:57.892
you'd go to your woman,
holding another woman's hand?

00:16:58.101 --> 00:17:00.728
N-No, uh...

00:17:01.563 --> 00:17:03.773
Just kidding!

00:17:03.982 --> 00:17:07.193
Watching Margery lying
around in some guy's arms

00:17:07.402 --> 00:17:12.532
won't be as much fun as going and
teasing Nietono for getting captured.

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.327
Now, get 90mg-

00:17:16.536 --> 00:17:20.748
Yes! Rebecca Reed-san and
Balar-san, thank you very much!

00:17:20.957 --> 00:17:23.209
It was nothing.

00:17:23.418 --> 00:17:27.130
Let us meet again at the crossroads
of destiny, Keisaku Sato-kun.

00:17:30.425 --> 00:17:34.012
Then, Transposer of Corpses
and Bodies, Ernest Frieder,

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:37.640
Tokyo Headquarters
command is in your hands.

00:17:37.849 --> 00:17:39.809
Understood.

00:17:40.018 --> 00:17:42.645
S-S-Sophie-chan, we'll do our best!

00:17:44.522 --> 00:17:50.445
Wilhelmina is just
now hearing from Rebecca.

00:17:50.653 --> 00:17:54.240
And there's my letter, as well.

00:17:56.242 --> 00:17:58.328
You have my thanks, indeed.

00:17:58.536 --> 00:18:00.163
Tomorrow, then.

00:18:00.371 --> 00:18:02.457
At the rendezvous point.

00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:06.211
Rebecca Reed came.

00:18:06.419 --> 00:18:08.254
Joyous happening.

00:18:08.463 --> 00:18:11.132
And this letter...

00:18:11.341 --> 00:18:16.846
"A Flame Haze is coming
to you, with classified information.

00:18:17.055 --> 00:18:20.892
Please make sure that
you cooperate with them."

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.572
A warrior worth a thousand others...

00:18:34.781 --> 00:18:38.117
The Scatterer of
Sparkling Light, Rebecca Reed...

00:18:38.326 --> 00:18:39.744
And one more...

00:18:39.953 --> 00:18:41.037
Yes.

00:18:41.246 --> 00:18:44.541
Yes, I believe it is about time.

00:18:51.923 --> 00:18:54.050
Your bath is ready.

00:19:10.692 --> 00:19:14.445
This is really what I attempted to do...

00:19:14.654 --> 00:19:17.574
Yuji tried to grab me.

00:19:20.076 --> 00:19:22.120
No...

00:19:22.328 --> 00:19:23.955
Not like that.

00:19:25.039 --> 00:19:28.167
That's right... This was it.

00:19:28.376 --> 00:19:33.089
I once took someone's hand this way...

00:19:37.844 --> 00:19:40.179
Go.

00:19:40.388 --> 00:19:41.806
Yes.

00:19:42.599 --> 00:19:44.892
You've taken care
of us for a long time.

00:19:45.101 --> 00:19:47.437
It wasn't for you...

00:19:47.645 --> 00:19:50.148
<i>'an. 'an.</i>

00:19:50.356 --> 00:19:53.443
I did it for love of Mathilde!

00:19:55.028 --> 00:19:57.447
I also love.

00:19:59.198 --> 00:20:00.825
Love?

00:20:01.034 --> 00:20:02.452
Yes.

00:20:09.334 --> 00:20:10.918
I see...

00:20:11.127 --> 00:20:14.422
Then me, too.

00:20:21.763 --> 00:20:24.182
Take my hand...

00:20:25.808 --> 00:20:27.226
<i>Okay -</i>

00:20:39.197 --> 00:20:42.450
What was there...

00:20:46.037 --> 00:20:49.123
What I've seen.

00:20:49.332 --> 00:20:52.126
I want to go with you.

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:59.676
I knew the power
in the palm of Yuji's hand.

00:21:01.344 --> 00:21:06.182
It was a familiar feeling.

00:21:06.391 --> 00:21:07.975
Remember...

00:21:08.184 --> 00:21:09.977
Here is the ultimate
Unrestricted Method,

00:21:10.186 --> 00:21:13.439
powerful enough to
imprison even a Crimson Lord,

00:21:13.648 --> 00:21:17.026
with but a single casting.

00:21:17.235 --> 00:21:21.280
Someday, find it for yourself.

00:21:22.949 --> 00:21:25.910
Shiro, I found it.

00:21:26.119 --> 00:21:28.830
The ultimate Unrestricted
Method is right here.

00:21:29.038 --> 00:21:30.665
That's right...

00:21:31.749 --> 00:21:33.167
It's love.

00:21:45.304 --> 00:21:47.140
What is this?

00:21:49.267 --> 00:21:51.602
The Supreme Throne!

00:21:51.811 --> 00:21:53.563
You are...

00:21:53.771 --> 00:21:55.189
...not needed.

00:21:58.109 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:01.279 --> 00:22:04.657
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.866 --> 00:22:07.827
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:08.035 --> 00:22:13.791
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:15.084
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.293 --> 00:22:18.379
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.588 --> 00:22:21.716
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.924 --> 00:22:25.136
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.344 --> 00:22:28.514
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.723 --> 00:22:31.851
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:32.059 --> 00:22:35.229
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.438 --> 00:22:39.150
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.358 --> 00:22:42.069
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.278 --> 00:22:48.618
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.826 --> 00:22:50.328
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.536 --> 00:22:51.579
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.788 --> 00:22:53.539
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.748 --> 00:22:57.168
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.376 --> 00:23:00.505
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.713 --> 00:23:03.925
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.133 --> 00:23:06.969
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:07.178 --> 00:23:10.723
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.932 --> 00:23:13.851
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:22.568
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:26.197 --> 00:23:29.367
Hecate appears before
a captive, helpless Shana,

00:23:29.575 --> 00:23:31.536
and attacks without warning.

00:23:31.744 --> 00:23:35.832
Meanwhile in Misaki City,
Yoshida encounters someone unexpected.

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:38.251
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.459 --> 00:23:40.044
"The Divine Gate."
